OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fovernight, although an isolated shower
OL,7,Fremains possible this evening. Large
OL,8,Fareas of dense fog forming again this
OL,9,Fevening, along with some frost.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FWidespread dense fog will be
OL,12,Fslow to clear on Monday, but some
OL,13,Fbright spells developing later.
OL,14,FPerhaps isolated coastal showers in
OL,15,FEssex. Feeling cool, especially where
OL,16,Ffog lingers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
