OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Tuesday, rain arriving later
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest. Wednesday a wet
OL,8,Fstart but soon turning drier. Perhaps
OL,9,Frather cloudy Thursday with isolated
OL,10,Fshowers. Temperatures near normal.
